<section class="container mt-5 pt-5">
    <div class="row mt-3">
        <div class="col-lg-12 section-title">
            <div class="testimonial-heading">
                <h2 class="title">How to Choose the Right Accommodation?</h2>
                <span class="shape-line"><i class="icon-19"></i></span>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-3">
            <h4>Safe Place for Stay Near Universities</h4>
            <p class="mt-3">Your safety is our top priority. We provide accommodations located in secure neighborhoods, close to top universities, so you can focus on your studies without worrying about long commutes or safety concerns. With 24/7 security measures and a student-friendly environment, you’ll feel at home from day one.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-3">
            <h4>Transparent Prices</h4>
            <p class="mt-3">No hidden fees, no surprises! Our pricing is completely transparent, ensuring you know exactly what you’re paying for. From rent to utilities, everything is clearly outlined, so you can plan your budget with confidence and avoid unexpected expenses.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-3">
            <h4>All-Inclusive Utilities</h4>
            <p class="mt-3">
                Say goodbye to the hassle of managing multiple bills. Our accommodations come with all-inclusive utilities, covering essentials like electricity, water, heating, and high-speed Wi-Fi. This means you can enjoy a comfortable stay without worrying about extra costs or service disruptions.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-3">
            <h4>Supportive Community</h4>
            <p class="mt-3">
                Living away from home can be challenging, but you’ll never feel alone. Our accommodations foster a supportive community where you can connect with fellow students, share experiences, and build lasting friendships. From social events to study groups, you’ll always have a network of peers to rely on.
            </p>
        </div>
        <div class="mt-3">
            <h4>Prime Location</h4>
            <p class="mt-3">
                Location matters, and we’ve got you covered! Our accommodations are situated in prime areas, offering easy access to universities, public transport, restaurants, and city attractions. Whether you’re heading to class or exploring the city, everything you need is just a short walk or ride away.
            </p>
        </div>
    </div>
</section>




